            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.55

- Added seamless same-motion reversal between next and previous artwork previews.
- Kept the current artwork centred while crossing the gesture origin, without an intermediate settling pause.
- Added directional hysteresis so intentional reversals feel immediate while small trackpad jitter remains ignored.
]]></description>
